Investigate an unresolved metallurgical question with independent and challengeable evidence (@metal-research: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @metals-and-metallurgical-production, #source "../sources/Theory-of-Transformations-in-Steels.lingua#r_3HDKH2533KSM4NXA88N6496T20", #source "../sources/Pycalphad-Methods-and-Documentation.lingua#r_24VWE1JCTVHMZ88907VK19ZWZR", #source "../sources/Quantitative-Phase-Field-Echebarria-and-Colleagues.lingua#r_20GWASGRYTPEAN3V8S54VRZ3GS", #source "../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB", #source "../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ", #metals-and-metallurgical-production "Completion-and-continuing-metallurgical-and-material-studies.lingua#r_0R83KVWADSY0WEENB0Q0E9A1N2") { r_631TWRB9DJYJVCFP74GBBAYQ9S
**Read:** [Theory of Transformations in Steels — Bhadeshia](../sources/Theory-of-Transformations-in-Steels.lingua#r_3HDKH2533KSM4NXA88N6496T20), the complete monograph and full primary/contrary works for a transformation question; [pycalphad — Otis and Liu, paper and computational thermodynamics](../sources/Pycalphad-Methods-and-Documentation.lingua#r_24VWE1JCTVHMZ88907VK19ZWZR), the full paper, assessment evidence, and exact documentation for a thermodynamic question; [Quantitative Phase-Field Model of Alloy Solidification — Echebarria and colleagues](../sources/Quantitative-Phase-Field-Echebarria-and-Colleagues.lingua#r_20GWASGRYTPEAN3V8S54VRZ3GS), the whole paper and later/independent comparisons for a solidification-model question; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), complete relevant industrial cases and primary methods; [Reproducible computational work](../../../inquiry/reproducible-computation/Reproducible-computation.lingua#r_78FWWJDCV0ZGG7VYSPRCWN56DQ), reuse independent validation, reproducibility, and preservation.

Define a consequential question that the substantial reading and prior projects do not settle. Possible directions include impurity/selectivity under realistic feed variation, coupled reactor/thermal/transport behavior, database/model identifiability, transformation mechanisms, scale-dependent defects/performance, process-control transfer, or recovery-quality limits. A current topic label is not itself a research gap.

Read complete foundational, later, independent comparison, and contradictory works. Reconstruct the assumptions, primary observations, methods, models/code, uncertainty, and inaccessible information behind the central claims. Distinguish an empirical prediction from a causal explanation and actual new information from a more elaborate fit.

Reproduce a substantial published result with independent calculations and design an analytic, experimental, numerical, field/operating, or rigorously scoped supplied-data investigation that could reject the preferred account. Test competing models, limiting and changed conditions, correlated measurement/selection errors, and transfer beyond calibration.

**Work:** produce an original scholarly argument with complete methods, authorized external sources, inspectable original calculations, uncertainty, failed predictions, alternatives, and independently supported conclusions. Explain what changes in scientific/engineering understanding and what remains unresolved. Another reader must be able to challenge and reproduce the central claim from the stated evidence. Practical competence is supported by the actual facilities, methods, supervision, and observations rather than inferred from publication-style prose.

**Continue:** [Explain, calculate, investigate, and defend a complete metallurgical system](Completion-and-continuing-metallurgical-and-material-studies.lingua#r_0R83KVWADSY0WEENB0Q0E9A1N2).

**Return:** [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).
